tar|models/kws/joiner.int8.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/kws-models/sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-gigaspeech-3.3M-2024-01-01.tar.bz2|sherpa-onnx-kws-zipformer-gigaspeech-3.3M-2024-01-01/joiner-epoch-12-avg-2-chunk-16-left-64.int8.onnx
