# --- Offline ASR (NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2, int8, NeMo transducer) ----------
# a full bidirectional context, which is markedly clearer on spontaneous speech than a
# chunk-by-chunk causal decoder. One ~482 MB tar.bz2 carries encoder/decoder/joiner +
# tokens (~632 MB extracted); the four `tar` entries below extract just the files we
# ship (the download is cached once, keyed by the archive's basename).
tar|models/asr/encoder.int8.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8.tar.bz2|sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8/encoder.int8.onnx
tar|models/asr/decoder.int8.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8.tar.bz2|sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8/decoder.int8.onnx
tar|models/asr/joiner.int8.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8.tar.bz2|sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8/joiner.int8.onnx
tar|models/asr/tokens.txt|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8.tar.bz2|sherpa-onnx-nemo-parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2-int8/tokens.txt

# --- Offline TTS (Piper en_US ryan, low, int8, male; sherpa-onnx converted) ---
# Sherpa-onnx VITS needs tokens.txt + espeak-ng-data in addition to the .onnx,
# so the whole converted model directory is extracted here.
tardir|models/tts|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/tts-models/vits-piper-en_US-ryan-low-int8.tar.bz2|vits-piper-en_US-ryan-low-int8

# --- Speech VAD (Silero VAD, fp32) -------------------------------------------
# Used by the EHS gate as the high-accuracy speech confirmor behind a cheap
# energy pre-filter. Silero v5 is the strongest on-device VAD (F1 ~0.99 vs
# WebRTC ~0.85) and its JNI already ships inside our prebuilt libsherpa-onnx-jni,
# so no native rebuild is needed. 16 kHz, window_size 512.
file|models/vad/silero_vad.onnx|https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/asr-models/silero_vad.onnx|
